<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Immortals</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Ten Thousand Immortals</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Immortals were an elite force of the Achaemenid Persian army, described by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/herodotus">Herodotus</a> as numbering ten thousand. According to him, any fallen or sick member was immediately replaced, keeping the unit at full strength. They served as royal guard and the core of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/achaemenid-empire">Achaemenid Empire</a>'s infantry.</p></div>
